  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scholar Enrichment Events Tertiary Education Institutions 2024-2027 Triennium</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity provides a fund for all Tertiary Education Institutions where there are scholars of the Manaaki New Zealand Scholarships Programme, to enrich those scholars&#x2019; learning and experience while studying in Aotearoa New Zealand. This progresses the scholarships outcome of strengthening scholar relationships with New Zealand.</narrative>
  </description>
